      "resolution_notes": "Modify the enableScissor mixin to capture the current PoseStack top matrix. Transform scissor coordinates: x' = (x * scale) + translationX, y' = (y * scale) + translationY. Re-push VkRect2D to command buffer when PoseStack is dirty."
